-## 10. Failure paths and edge conditions
-
-**Every rejection returns 0 and none of them is distinguishable from a genuine award of 0.** The
-list, in evaluation order for experience: null recipient skips the recipient checks *but not the
-corpse checks*; recipient kind non-zero; `0031B860` returning null; recipient id in `0x1B`–`0x27`;
-either status word carrying `0x80000003`; null corpse; null `+0x698`; corpse kind not `1`; on the
