-
-```
-Recipient stats record
-  +0x04   u8    compared against 0x1B..0x27 range when +0x05 is zero
-  +0x05   u8    selects which eligibility clauses apply
-  +0x3C   u32   status layer A  }  OR'd, then masked 0x80000003
-  +0x64   u32   status layer B  }
