-**Eligibility — exact, both EXP and LP:**
-
-```
-eligible  iff  (recipient[0x64] | recipient[0x3C]) & 0x80000003  ==  0
-          &&   foe != NULL && foe.pBkbi != NULL
-          &&   foe.pBkbi.wDefinitionSelector[+1] == 1
-          &&   ( recipient[5] != 0
-                 || ( FindOwningBattleUnit(recipient) != NULL
