-
-shared path:   amount = ( foe.bLevel - <term> + authoredSection7[0x34] ) / count
-growth path:   amount = ( foe.bLevel - foe.bGrowthBaseLevel ) * <term>
-               if <cond>  amount *= 2
-               if <cond>  amount  = 0
-```
-
-`0x80000003` = bits 0, 1 and 31 — the same three bits the action gate tests.
