-  also change who earns EXP and LP, whether or not that was intended.
-- **EXP is divided by a live count of eligible recipients**, so anything that changes
-  eligibility changes everyone else's share.
-- **An authored per-foe value at section-7 `+0x34`** feeds the shared path — a data knob, not a
-  code constant.
