 # How experience is computed and divided
 
-`Reward_ComputeExperienceForRecipient` at **`002F8BB0`**, 430 bytes. Six documents cited it; none had
-opened it.
+> **SECTION-03 production review, 2026-09-22; independent peer acceptance pending.**
